{"ref":"BDB, חָמֵץ","hw":"חָמֵץ","html":"† I. <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָמֵץ</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. be sour, leavened (</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, Pi. Hiph. <em>make sour, leaven;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">حَمُضَ</span> <em>be sour;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמַע</span> <em>be sour, leavened</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܡܰܥ</span>, <em>be leavened</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָמֵץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:39\" href=\"/Exodus.12.39\">Ex 12:39</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶחְמָ֑ץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:34\" href=\"/Exodus.12.34\">Ex 12:34</a>; Inf. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֻמְצָתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:4\" href=\"/Hosea.7.4\">Ho 7:4</a>;—<em>be leavened</em>, of dough <span dir=\"rtl\">(בָּצֵק)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:34\" href=\"/Exodus.12.34\">Ex 12:34</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:39\" href=\"/Exodus.12.39\">39</a> (E), cf. <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:4\" href=\"/Hosea.7.4\">Ho 7:4</a>.<br><strong>Hithp.</strong>  <em>be soured, embittered</em>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:21\" href=\"/Psalms.73.21\">ψ 73:21</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּלְיוֹתַי אֶשְׁתּוֹנָן</span>).","next":"BDB, חָמֵץ²","prev":"BDB, תַּחְמָס"}